      "side": 1,
      "message": "The tc_check_vconn_swap() is used in the context when port partner requests vconn swap and TC evaluates what to respond, accept/reject, etc, it checks for reject flag too. And here the case is if we  can request to be vconn source. I feel better not to mix those two. What do you think?",
